#!/bin/sh
# Work-log check: refuses a commit that changes project files without also changing WORKLOG.md.
#
# Enable once per clone (from the repository root):   git config core.hooksPath .githooks
# Skip for a single commit:  Git Bash    WORKLOG_SKIP=1 git commit ...
#                            PowerShell  $env:WORKLOG_SKIP=1; git commit ...; Remove-Item Env:WORKLOG_SKIP

[ "${WORKLOG_SKIP:-0}" = "1" ] && exit 0

staged=$(git diff --cached --name-only)
[ -z "$staged" ] && exit 0
printf '%s\n' "$staged" | grep -qx 'WORKLOG.md' && exit 0

cat >&2 <<'MSG'

Commit refused: WORKLOG.md is not part of this commit.

  1. Add a line for this change under today's date in WORKLOG.md (section "Done").
  2. git add WORKLOG.md
  3. Commit again.

To skip this check for one commit, see the top of .githooks/pre-commit.

MSG
exit 1
